WEBVTT

00:02:28.311 --> 00:02:33.566
I see how living under constant
threat of violence and feeling unsafe

00:02:33.608 --> 00:02:35.693
can affect people,

00:02:35.693 --> 00:02:37.987
even when they manage to get out.

00:02:38.738 --> 00:02:43.409
War leaves a physical legacy in our body,

00:02:43.409 --> 00:02:45.995
our mind and in our spirit.

00:02:47.330 --> 00:02:49.040
When I tell people about my life,

00:02:49.081 --> 00:02:52.126
they sometimes say
it's a remarkable story.

00:02:52.168 --> 00:02:53.461
But this is not true.

00:02:54.670 --> 00:02:58.799
Millions of people are living
through war and displacement,

00:02:58.841 --> 00:03:00.801
trying to survive.